{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.142.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79357,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb861d5a097e5bd1152703849dd3deba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, Kendia and Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding in St Thomas!!! You&#039;ve come to the right place to find lots of great ideas, support and advice from everyone here to help with your planning decisions, so well done on a great start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are some beautiful beach wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera.......enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;......taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150344652834487.362195.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Timeline Photos Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11112904_10153437585749487_5606464172347900185_o.jpg\" alt=\"11112904_10153437585749487_5606464172347\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11696407_10153437601474487_635021991081118739_o.jpg\" alt=\"11696407_10153437601474487_6350219910811\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11703262_10153423444214487_8180856439592055919_o.jpg\" alt=\"11703262_10153423444214487_8180856439592\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - it&#039;ll be Great!!!&amp;nbsp; team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900074,"PostDate":1436422338,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, Kendia and Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding in St Thomas!!! You've come to the right place to find lots of great ideas, support and advice from everyone here to help with your planning decisions, so well done on a great start already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are some beautiful beach wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured in our magnificent Mayan Riviera.......enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>......taken from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150344652834487.362195.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Timeline Photos Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11112904_10153437585749487_5606464172347900185_o.jpg\" alt=\"11112904_10153437585749487_5606464172347\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11696407_10153437601474487_635021991081118739_o.jpg\" alt=\"11696407_10153437601474487_6350219910811\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11703262_10153423444214487_8180856439592055919_o.jpg\" alt=\"11703262_10153423444214487_8180856439592\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - it'll be Great!!!\u00a0 team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.223.91.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79357,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64618fb10e1650b3e8dbe8f6f1a86326","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ll do great.&amp;nbsp; Begin to think like someone who is coming to the area for a mini vacation.  &amp;nbsp; What would you want to know about the area, things to do, price range of things to do in the area, great places to eat.&amp;nbsp; I know that where I am there are canopy tours, white water rafting, horse back riding, tours of wineries and tours of waterfalls.&amp;nbsp; Lots to do over the course of three or four days, especially if a wedding is part of the festivities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Nancy @ Rabun Manor&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":33037,"Name":"porch view 025.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-282859-0-91328900-1436733349.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-282859-0-91328900-1436733349.jpg","Width":0,"Height":0},{"Id":33038,"Name":"porch view 021.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-282859-0-67853900-1436733428.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2015\/post-282859-0-67853900-1436733428_thumb.jpg","Width":828,"Height":1200}],"Id":1900280,"PostDate":1436737045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You'll do great.\u00a0 Begin to think like someone who is coming to the area for a mini vacation.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 What would you want to know about the area, things to do, price range of things to do in the area, great places to eat.\u00a0 I know that where I am there are canopy tours, white water rafting, horse back riding, tours of wineries and tours of waterfalls.\u00a0 Lots to do over the course of three or four days, especially if a wedding is part of the festivities.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Nancy @ Rabun Manor<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nancychldrss@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.223.91.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1429994252,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"revnancy","Id":282859,"Name":"revnancy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79357,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3bff3d484c466962e4563b6da6099b5d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome!! 10 months away, how exciting!! This forum has been BEYOND helpful to me, and all the girls here are fantastic.&amp;nbsp; St.Thomas sounds beautiful :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900342,"PostDate":1436825878,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome!! 10 months away, how exciting!! This forum has been BEYOND helpful to me, and all the girls here are fantastic.\u00a0 St.Thomas sounds beautiful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424117850,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.113.222.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79357,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c317b3f6b3d3f86d351244653363790d","RawContent":"As I see you got married in st Thomas if you don&#039;t mind me asking which resort did you have your wedding at. I am so confused at what hotel is best. And st Thomas is where we want to get married at.\n\nThanks","Attachments":[],"Id":1903404,"PostDate":1440561760,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                As I see you got married in st Thomas if you don't mind me asking which resort did you have your wedding at. I am so confused at what hotel is best. And st Thomas is where we want to get married at.<br>\nThanks\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440298010,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.252.251.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79357,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1deaa62f09db582043fcaa33c4615985","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Kendia\" post=\"1899977\" timestamp=\"1436354971\"]\nHello,\n\nI just joined today.  I&#039;ll be getting married in 10 months!  So excited and terrified at the same time.  Anyways...I&#039;m looking forward to learning from my new Best Destination Wedding family, God knows I need the help...lol[\/quote]Hello Kendia,\n\nYou can look at the Website of Grand Palladium! There&#039;s really nice wedding&#039;s packages for every budget and it&#039;s a beautiful resort for family.\nWebsite: [url=\"http:\/\/bit.ly\/1Ka0zPK\"]http:\/\/bit.ly\/1Ka0zPK[\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1904657,"PostDate":1442245488,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Kendia, on 08 July 2015 - 04:29 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just joined today. \u00a0I'll be getting married in 10 months! \u00a0So excited and terrified at the same time. \u00a0Anyways...I'm looking forward to learning from my new Best Destination Wedding family, God knows I need the help...lol<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hello Kendia,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can look at the Website of Grand Palladium! There's really nice wedding's packages for every budget and it's a beautiful resort for family.<\/p>\n<p>Website:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/bit.ly\/1Ka0zPK' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bit.ly\/1Ka0zPK<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cassiopee_mertens@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"72.252.251.30","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441907660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TropicCassy24","Id":284758,"Name":"TropicCassy24","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
