{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":435,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1899914,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":283847,"Name":"abeautyandthebusiness","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283847.jpg?_r=1436278737","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1436283190,"LastPoster":{"Id":283847,"Name":"abeautyandthebusiness","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283847.jpg?_r=1436278737","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1899914,"PostDate":1436283190,"PostContent":"Hello everyone! I just wanted to introduce myself! I am Meg, I run a beauty blog on the side, AND...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Soon to be a Jellyfish Bride!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos done by <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/KAMeraDesigns'>KAMera Photography\u00a0<\/a>\u00a0(Philly\/NJ based)\u00a0","Email":"m.mcmahon91@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.114.58.138","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436281499,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283847.jpg?_r=1436278737","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"abeautyandthebusiness","Id":283847,"Name":"abeautyandthebusiness","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.114.58.138","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79355,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2760e16601acd2b8538bcf78a2480d6f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello everyone! I just wanted to introduce myself! I am Meg, I run a beauty blog on the side, AND I am currently planning our Destination Wedding in Punta Cana at the JellyFish!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am so excited to be joining and starting to plan our wedding! Any tips for a newbie to this board\/planning a wedding in Punta Cana??&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899914,"PostDate":1436283190,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello everyone! I just wanted to introduce myself! I am Meg, I run a beauty blog on the side, AND I am currently planning our Destination Wedding in Punta Cana at the JellyFish!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am so excited to be joining and starting to plan our wedding! Any tips for a newbie to this board\/planning a wedding in Punta Cana??\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Soon to be a Jellyfish Bride!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos done by <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/KAMeraDesigns'>KAMera Photography\u00a0<\/a>\u00a0(Philly\/NJ based)\u00a0","Email":"m.mcmahon91@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.114.58.138","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436281499,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283847.jpg?_r=1436278737","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"abeautyandthebusiness","Id":283847,"Name":"abeautyandthebusiness","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79355,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b42aaee8fa2914e1a524c72ea0bb28fe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats and welcome to the site! There are several past and present Punta Cana brides here! Just do a search in the search bar up top and I know you&#039;ll connect to several forums that you can read through. Definitely spend some time looking and reading. The ladies here are more than willing to pass on their experiences!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899917,"PostDate":1436284648,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats and welcome to the site! There are several past and present Punta Cana brides here! Just do a search in the search bar up top and I know you'll connect to several forums that you can read through. Definitely spend some time looking and reading. The ladies here are more than willing to pass on their experiences!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to say yes again....October 20, 2015\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79355,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"afb196fc37e390bdaa29bdc1283da027","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats! I&#039;m sure you will find this forum super helpful. I&#039;ve seen a lot of posts about Jellyfish on here - it seems like a great spot :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899920,"PostDate":1436285793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! I'm sure you will find this forum super helpful. I've seen a lot of posts about Jellyfish on here - it seems like a great spot <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.26.218","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79355,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63a942086f9444b5bae6fd782de8f47c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Meg and Congrats on your upcoming DR JellyFish wedding!!! You&#039;ll find lots of great resources here to help with your planning decisions, so well done on getting a wonderful start :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For some added inspiration, here are some magical beach wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera......enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sjc2-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/11427375_10153408854794487_4566310682341134022_o.jpg\" alt=\"11427375_10153408854794487_4566310682341\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sjc2-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/11334252_10153357324994487_6025654323044648467_o.jpg\" alt=\"11334252_10153357324994487_6025654323044\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sjc2-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10264266_10152377393459487_387743739374526349_o.jpg\" alt=\"10264266_10152377393459487_3877437393745\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899928,"PostDate":1436292450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Meg and Congrats on your upcoming DR JellyFish wedding!!! You'll find lots of great resources here to help with your planning decisions, so well done on getting a wonderful start <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some added inspiration, here are some magical beach wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured in our beautiful Mayan Riviera......enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sjc2-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtf1\/t31.0-8\/11427375_10153408854794487_4566310682341134022_o.jpg\" alt=\"11427375_10153408854794487_4566310682341\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sjc2-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/11334252_10153357324994487_6025654323044648467_o.jpg\" alt=\"11334252_10153357324994487_6025654323044\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sjc2-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10264266_10152377393459487_387743739374526349_o.jpg\" alt=\"10264266_10152377393459487_3877437393745\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.114.58.138","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79355,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee8f11915063649fc369efb313252887","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] and&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"perianjay\"] and&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"Moments That Matter\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you for the welcome! I have been going back and looking and there is so much information! I am so glad out photographer suggested this site to us! I do have to say We don&#039;t really have much to do for now other than worry about a resort. We just want to book everything now to guarantee we have the venders we want for our wedding!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1899973,"PostDate":1436327507,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> and\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> and\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"230711\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/230711-moments-that-matter\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Moments That Matter<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you for the welcome! I have been going back and looking and there is so much information! I am so glad out photographer suggested this site to us! I do have to say We don't really have much to do for now other than worry about a resort. We just want to book everything now to guarantee we have the venders we want for our wedding!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Soon to be a Jellyfish Bride!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos done by <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/KAMeraDesigns'>KAMera Photography\u00a0<\/a>\u00a0(Philly\/NJ based)\u00a0","Email":"m.mcmahon91@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.114.58.138","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436281499,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283847.jpg?_r=1436278737","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"abeautyandthebusiness","Id":283847,"Name":"abeautyandthebusiness","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79355","Title":"Just Joined! Soon To Be A Jellyfish Bride","LastPostDate":1436327507},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
